{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":544146,\"title\":\"Varning! Harning!\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The controversial Swedish author Anderz Harning (1938-1992) share component of his writing, his sources of inspiration and his never ending anger. \\\"Didn't I say so/Vad var det jag sa\\\" are the challenging words on his memorial stone. Anderz Harning was a major critic of the modern bureaucratic society, nepotism and abuse of power. In his autobiographical novels \\\"Stålbadet\\\" and \\\"Asfåglarna\\\", he reflects on his upbringing in a Nazi home in Sweden.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6U1uHRWkiuJXVPus1D8jgUKE9mS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1983,\"runtime\":39,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"SE\",\"name\":\"Sweden\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Jonas Sima\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2018008,\"name\":\"Jonas Sima\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s6DmeHjOREUZhieorUWlUET7Cnm.jpg\"},{\"id\":2113704,\"name\":\"Anderz Harning\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xsbDHEvExOXxr7EN8w0wOwPNHbb.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":656274,\"title\":\"Little Girl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kciAX2iBP09RfZ9d2ldLjgHiL2u.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wurw1SCnmGdzMPF3gKNIG16jIQz.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"7-year-old Sasha has always known that she is a girl. Sasha’s family has recently accepted her gender identity, embracing their daughter for who she truly is while working to confront outdated norms and find affirmation in a small community of rural France.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1043339,\"title\":\"A Life Like Any Other\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vjicQdM58wnHbeOACI13l5LfbUN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nNXDAoZKsM8i3WuknaGGp2y9W1.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Over many years, the director’s father filmed his family life almost obsessively. His daughter’s birth, his son’s first steps, and always Valérie, the young mother. An impressive fund of material which their now grown-up daughter Faustine appropriates to tell quite a different story: that of a woman who sees her role as a mother and its demands take away her freedom step by step.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1627811,\"title\":\"Enrico Mattei, le rebelle du pétrole\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2LfJ4Dr8lYK3rJiWCeftZqgEC9n.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/myeX78k2TV3rPlqNIE32IdYkmN2.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1635360,\"title\":\"La Station spatiale internationale - Missions à haut risque\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jV9vA0AkzVxDyd6bcS6q3i0yi9I.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hZGs0QaaBEtm82X9ioRW3G7h57e.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":719188,\"title\":\"La Folle Aventure de Louis de Funès\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9rdoNIlDNtqXiLHkA5kAXAlaRit.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yvZeVamxfVwhkO4l2Dd4nrONqoy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":642943,\"title\":\"Andreas Gabalier – 10 Jahre Volks-Rock'n'Roller: Das Portrait\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nEpFC1jh4Hp4Gu9VHpbF7ucTDNt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ygzqtj5ZqMnLiLLYjVjllJs4l5Y.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1624968,\"title\":\"Les Glucksmann, une histoire de famille\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pQZxuFZGsNAebHiLrmtaPKaaYRh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4KsqR7IUMY0UoYOxP48nEL5Th0z.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1624827,\"title\":\"Marvin Gaye - Visionär des Soul\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gIXrxDKNHyqHdPEPGD0vA2jJymF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e8qstgaG82O7EYL1dFw0FTWPQVI.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"He was the gentle rebel of soul: Marvin Gaye, one of the greatest musicians of the 20th century. With his unmistakable voice and hits, he left an indelible mark on American pop culture—one that endures to this day.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1325605,\"title\":\"Dieu peut se défendre tout seul\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/38gJs4JwTOEnOdx5L8y7cKtXiIL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6RMQDqebafXcpd5ASnpnrx368jy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":650614,\"title\":\"Lorena: Light-Footed Woman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nDEXcwY18WyBnYrSDAmHgjTEqSX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nNPPSayuKo7VC0swRaZft676dLk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young woman of the Tarahumara, well-known for their extraordinary long distance running abilities, wins ultramarathons seemingly out of nowhere despite running in sandals.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1438303,\"title\":\"I carve smiles into mountains' wounds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ypl39BsNWT1gW8P1txlXvcVPkSG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbEtUivejD4j7uyuKF395YkY2N4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Achour is thirty. Night and day, he walks. Rebellious soul, he crisscrosses Alger and its neighborhoods, stays at friends' houses and often leaves the city to meet the nearby montain in Kabylia, his alter-ego. In this environment his resistance continues, mobile and ascending. Algerian hardcore-punk musician, Achour once screamed his anger against the country's regime and sang \\\"Anarchytecture\\\". But the movement died down, friends went their separate ways. His Facebook wall became his notebook, his window open to the world. It represents a scream aimed towards the echo of the mountains, between virtual wall, infinite facades of large complexes and the strata of mineral cliffs. A scream comes back at us.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"1Is8d_FnMTg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"7a6YFwC2zKA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Xeto4CMwvzA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}